        <div class="myth-grid">
          <article class="myth wrong"><div class="myth-mark">×</div><div><h3>Modello errato</h3><p>Ethernet → IP → MPLS → OSPF → BGP come cinque involucri permanenti dello stesso pacchetto.</p></div></article>
